{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124170","id":4741788074,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGqHxqg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124170","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124170/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124170/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124170/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f8616156eaa61f24e2e8eb64fbe325fd9b07c0d","number":124170,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix script tooltip appearing outside script editor","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n- Closes #124154\r\n\r\nFixes a regression where the script tooltip pops up outside the editor if you hover over a symbol and quickly move your mouse out of the text area. \r\n\r\nThis issue started in `f27afd713d` which introduced a new `hover_tooltip_timer` in `ScriptTextEditor` to show errors and warnings. \r\nThe problem is that the timer was only being canceled when the mouse left the entire `ScriptTextEditor` container, which often fails to catch the exit event if you move the cursor out of the text box really fast.\r\n\r\nThe fix is simple: we just stop the timer using the internal `CodeEdit`'s `mouse_exited` signal instead, which fires reliably the moment the mouse leaves the text area. \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n### Before:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b026e34-c544-4b98-ac7e-f198ffde0b51\r\n\r\n### After:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/774afbc9-ecae-4848-9ec8-b6caae0f9da7\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/